C-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
C          DRY CREEK RIM INFLOW CORRECTION (C2VSimFG 1.5+cb11)
C   Column 29 (stream node 2442, head of reach 49, Dry Creek) held the USGS
C   11329500 gage record (Dry Creek near Galt, 324 sq mi) divided by 3.95, the
C   drainage-area ratio to the 82 sq mi above the model boundary.  Of the
C   remaining 242 sq mi, 100 sq mi is already represented by small watersheds
C   885-888 discharging to node 2456; the other 142 sq mi was represented
C   nowhere.  All 576 monthly values in column 29 multiplied by 2.73 =
C   (324 - 100) / 82, so the inflow plus those small watersheds together carry
C   the full gaged 324 sq mi (annual mean 25.9 to 70.8 TAF/yr for WY1974-2015,
C   21.3 to 58.1 TAF/yr for WY2016-2021).
